<div><div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Graduate Teaching Assistant, Global Innovation</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">NYU Tandon · New York</div></div>
<div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">May 2025 – May 2026</div>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 16px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6">
<div><div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Product Manager Intern</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Method, a Hitachi Company · New York · <a href={`${base}work/#nexus`}>Nexus</a></div></div>
<div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Jun – Aug 2025</div>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 16px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6">
<div><div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Engagement Ambassador</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">NYU · New York</div></div>
<div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Jan – May 2025</div>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 16px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6">
<div><div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Product Manager</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Inflection.io · Remote · <a href={`${base}work/#inflection`}>Case study</a></div></div>
<div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Mar 2023 – Aug 2024</div>
</li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 16px; padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6">
<div><div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">Product Engineer</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Inflection.io · Remote</div></div>
<div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">Aug 2022 – Feb 2023</div>
</li>
</ul>
</div>

<div style="flex: 1 1 300px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px">
<div>
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #595959; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em">Education</h3>
<div style="padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e6e6e6">
<div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600">M.S., Management of Technology</div>
<div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px; color: #595959">NYU Tandon School of Engineering · 2024 – 2026</div>
</div>
