</div>
</div>

</div>

<div style="margin-top: 64px">
<h3 style="margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #595959; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em">Skills</h3>
