<div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px">Tools</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #595959">Figma, Jira, Grafana, Firebase, Excel</p>
